sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as External Developer
    participant API as POST /v1/chat
    participant Auth as API Key Middleware
    participant Quota as Rate Limiter (api_rpm)
    participant RAG as RAG + LLM

    Dev->>API: chat(agent_id, message) + Authorization: Bearer sk_ora_...
    API->>Auth: validate key hash + required scope (chat:write)
    alt invalid key
        Auth-->>Dev: 401 Unauthorized
    else missing scope
        Auth-->>Dev: 403 Forbidden
    else valid
        Auth->>Quota: enforce_rate_limit(api_rpm)
        alt rate exceeded
            Quota-->>Dev: 429 Too Many Requests
        else within limit
            Quota->>RAG: run grounded chat pipeline
            RAG-->>API: answer + citations
            API-->>Dev: 200 JSON {answer, sources, confidence}
        end
    end
